        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "ANP currently manufactures heparin sodium for our enoxaparin product, isoproterenol, hyaluronidase, and medroxyprogesterone for Amphastar’s current products, and we plan to have ANP manufacture APIs and starting materials for APIs for certain other products and product candidates.",
