        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In addition, we are developing formulations using a new environmentally friendly propellant for use in future MDI products as part of our ongoing efforts to advance inhalation technologies.",
