        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We also sell REXTOVY®, our prescription naloxone nasal spray product delivered using our proprietary device, which is intended to be used for the emergency treatment of known or suspected opioid overdose as manifested by respiratory and/or central nervous system depression.",
